<code>assert !\old(c == null) => \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < c.size(); this.get(i).equals(c.toArray()[i]);</code>

This assert statement checks that if the input collection `c` is not null, then after adding all its elements to the list, each element in the list at index `i` is equal to the element in the collection at the same index `i`.
